#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_purchase_order__journal_id
msgid "Invoicing Journal"
msgstr "Jurnal de facturare"

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_purchase_order__journal_id
msgid ""
"If set, the vendor bill is created in this journal and in its currency (the "
"company currency when the journal has none); the order prices are converted "
"at the bill date rate. If empty, the bill is in the order currency."
msgstr ""
"Dacă este completat, factura furnizorului se creează în acest jurnal și în "
"moneda lui (moneda companiei, dacă jurnalul nu are monedă); prețurile din "
"comandă se convertesc la cursul de la data facturii. Dacă este gol, factura "
"este în moneda comenzii."

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_move__purchase_vendor_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_bank_statement_line__purchase_vendor_rate
msgid "Vendor Rate"
msgstr "Curs furnizor"

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_move__purchase_vendor_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_bank_statement_line__purchase_vendor_rate
msgid ""
"Exchange rate used for the order prices: bill currency for 1 unit of the "
"order currency (e.g. 5.1 RON for 1 EUR). Filled in with the Odoo rate of the "
"bill date; type the rate stated on the vendor invoice after setting the bill "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Cursul de schimb folosit pentru prețurile din comandă: moneda facturii pentru "
"1 unitate din moneda comenzii (de ex. 5,1 RON pentru 1 EUR). Se completează "
"cu cursul din Odoo de la data facturii; introduceți cursul de pe factura "
"furnizorului după ce setați data facturii."

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_move__purchase_source_currency_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_bank_statement_line__purchase_source_currency_id
msgid "Order Currency"
msgstr "Moneda comenzii"

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_move__purchase_source_currency_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_bank_statement_line__purchase_source_currency_id
msgid ""
"Currency of the purchase orders billed here, when it is a single one and "
"differs from the bill currency."
msgstr ""
"Moneda comenzilor de achiziție facturate aici, când este una singură și "
"diferă de moneda facturii."

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/deltatech_purchase_currency/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The vendor rate cannot be negative."
msgstr "Cursul furnizorului nu poate fi negativ."

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:deltatech_purchase_currency.view_move_form
msgid "per 1"
msgstr "pentru 1"

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_move__purchase_odoo_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_bank_statement_line__purchase_odoo_rate
msgid "Odoo Rate"
msgstr "Curs Odoo"

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_move__purchase_odoo_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:deltatech_purchase_currency.field_account_bank_statement_line__purchase_odoo_rate
msgid ""
"Last rate filled in automatically in Vendor Rate; a different Vendor Rate "
"was typed by hand."
msgstr ""
"Ultimul curs completat automat în Curs furnizor; un Curs furnizor diferit a "
"fost introdus manual."

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/deltatech_purchase_currency/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "Vendor rate replaced"
msgstr "Cursul furnizorului a fost înlocuit"

#. module: deltatech_purchase_currency
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/deltatech_purchase_currency/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The vendor rate %(typed)s was replaced with the rate of %(date)s: %(rate)s "
"%(currency)s for 1 %(order_currency)s. If the vendor invoice states another "
"rate, type it again."
msgstr ""
"Cursul furnizorului %(typed)s a fost înlocuit cu cursul din %(date)s: "
"%(rate)s %(currency)s pentru 1 %(order_currency)s. Dacă factura furnizorului "
"are alt curs, introduceți-l din nou."
